## 8. Architecture Overview

```
                         ┌───────────────────────────┐
                         │      Orchestrator Agent     │
                         │  (LangGraph state machine)  │
                         └──────────────┬──────────────┘
              ┌───────────────┬─────────┼─────────┬───────────────┐
        Requirement       Location   Transport  Accommodation   Activities
         Interview                                                  │
              │               │          │            │             │
          Weather           Budget    Risk&Safety  Itinerary     Validation
                                                     Planner          │
                                                                 Replanning
                                                                      │
                                                                  Booking
                                                                  (gated)
```

- **Pattern:** graph / state-machine (LangGraph), not a single autonomous prompt. Every transition between agents is explicit, inspectable, and independently testable.
- **Stack:** Python, FastAPI, LangGraph, Pydantic, PostgreSQL, Redis, MCP, React/Next.js frontend.
- **Core principle:** *agents reason; tools retrieve and calculate.* No LLM performs arithmetic, distance math, or authoritative data retrieval — those are deterministic services behind MCP tool contracts.

